WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:07.200
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am&nbsp;
going to explain a Korean Comedy Drama film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:15.920
called “Granny's Got Talent.” Spoilers&nbsp;
ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:22.720
The protagonist of the movie is an old woman known&nbsp;
as Granny. She has been living in prison for the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:28.720
past few decades for not paying her debts. A day&nbsp;
before getting out, she boasts about her sons’&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:34.240
achievements to her cellmates. Her older son works&nbsp;
in a prestigious company while her younger one is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:40.240
a musician. Despite both of them having different&nbsp;
fathers, they are both diligent like her. Granny&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:46.000
gets out of the prison the next day but no one&nbsp;
comes to pick her up. While she is in a subway,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:52.000
she witnesses a middle-aged man harassing a young&nbsp;
girl. Since no one else intervenes, she speaks up&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:57.840
for the girl and cusses the man. The entire crowd&nbsp;
is stunned to hear her vocabulary of curse words.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:08.800
At the next stop, she kicks the man out. Granny’s&nbsp;
elder son is named Seung-hyeon. He works an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:14.640
average job at a prestigious company and is always&nbsp;
disrespected by his co-workers. When Seung-hyeon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:19.520
was little, Granny’s debt collectors used to&nbsp;
yell at him because of her. On being sentenced&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.520 --> 00:01:24.640
to prison, she left him in an orphanage, because&nbsp;
of which he has hated her his entire life.
&nbsp;

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:29.680
Seung-hyeon lives with his wealthy in-laws&nbsp;
and has been working hard to someday buy a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.680 --> 00:01:35.280
house of his own and move with his wife and&nbsp;
son. Somewhere else, a media company thinks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:40.480
of an exciting television program to bring in&nbsp;
revenue. They organize a non censored cursing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:40.480 --> 00:01:46.160
competition. The only problem is that they are&nbsp;
short on participants. PD Yang and her associate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:51.680
are given the responsibility to look for the&nbsp;
top insulters of the city. Granny’s younger son,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.680 --> 00:01:57.600
Joo-hyeon is unemployed and lives off his wife’s&nbsp;
income. They welcome Granny in their house,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.600 --> 00:02:06.160
mostly because she hands his wife a bundle of&nbsp;
money as a gift. Granny finds out that her elder&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:12.880
son is living with his in-laws. She knows that he&nbsp;
dislikes her but still wants to meet him. So, pays&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:18.560
a man to land her the job as a maid at his house.&nbsp;
The next day, she goes to his house for the first&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:18.560 --> 00:02:24.000
time and is briefed about her job by the previous&nbsp;
maid. The maid also mentions that Seung-hyeon’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:29.280
mother-in-law wants the housemaid to be fluent&nbsp;
in English. Granny says a few English words to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.280 --> 00:02:33.600
make her believe she is in fact fluent. 
Although it is difficult to work as a maid at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:39.520
her age, she doesn’t mind as long as she gets to&nbsp;
see her son, daughter-in-law, and grandson. For&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.520 --> 00:02:45.840
the past few days, PD Yang and her associate have&nbsp;
been looking for foul-mouthed people of the town.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:45.840 --> 00:02:50.400
They hear about Granny from someone and set&nbsp;
out to look for her. Granny finally meets&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:56.000
Seung-hyeon but he isn’t happy to see her. He&nbsp;
ignores her entirely and gets in a car with the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:56.000 --> 00:03:00.880
chairman of his company and his mother-in-law.&nbsp;
The chairman also sees Granny who reminds him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:06.400
of a kind lady he had met when he was in prison.&nbsp;
The lady had stopped him from committing suicide&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:11.920
so he is always thankful to her. Granny cannot&nbsp;
sleep at night because of her son’s indifference&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:17.920
to her arrival. She walks to a nearby park&nbsp;
and screams profanities to no one. PD Yang,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:25.840
who is also at the park hears her but cannot&nbsp;
find her in the dark. Starting the next day, she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:31.600
and her associate stay at the park waiting for the&nbsp;
foul-mouthed old lady. The next day, Seung-hyeon’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:36.800
mother-in-law brings an English teacher to&nbsp;
test if Granny lied about her qualifications.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.800 --> 00:03:42.000
The teacher quickly catches up to her lie and&nbsp;
reveals she doesn’t know how to speak English.
&nbsp;

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:47.280
The mother-in-law is furious and wants to fire&nbsp;
her, but Seung-hyeon’s wife insists they do&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:47.280 --> 00:03:52.720
not need someone who speaks in English just to do&nbsp;
household work. When Granny returns home that day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:52.720 --> 00:03:58.160
she hears Joo-hyeon and his wife arguing. It turns&nbsp;
out that he gambled away the money she had given&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:58.160 --> 00:04:03.680
them. Joo-hyeon and Granny go to the park where&nbsp;
reveals that he needs a lot of money to pay off&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:10.400
his debt. Just then, PD Yang finds Granny and asks&nbsp;
her to be in their show. At first Granny declines&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:15.680
the offer. But PD Yang doesn't stop trying to&nbsp;
persuade her. Eventually, she agrees to do it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.680 --> 00:04:20.480
for the three hundred thousand dollar prize&nbsp;
money. Finally, the auditions for the swearing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:25.520
competition take place. The judges dismiss most&nbsp;
of the contestants because they do not match their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:25.520 --> 00:04:31.120
standards. When it is Granny’s turn to audition,&nbsp;
she is blinded by the spotlight and cannot speak.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:34.240 --> 00:04:39.680
One of the judges makes fun of her for being old&nbsp;
which triggers her. She curses her heart out at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:44.800
the judge and gets instantly selected. 
Somewhere else, Seung-hyeon’s wife and his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:49.520
mother-in-law go to meet the Chairman’s wife&nbsp;
to maintain their social status. While waiting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:49.520 --> 00:04:54.720
for her, they discuss Granny’s behavior and how&nbsp;
she lied about her qualifications. As they talk,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:54.720 --> 00:05:00.400
the mother-in-law also suggests the wife divorce&nbsp;
a loser like Seung-hyeon. They mistakenly leave&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:05.200
Granny’s CV with her picture on the table.&nbsp;
When the chairman's wife arrives a while later,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:10.320
she recognizes Granny as an old friend who she&nbsp;
respects the most. It turns out that although&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.320 --> 00:05:15.520
she is wealthy, she had once stolen Granny’s money&nbsp;
and was the reason that she had to leave her kids&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:15.520 --> 00:05:21.360
and go to jail. She feels very sorry for Granny&nbsp;
and plans to meet her to ask for forgiveness.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:21.360 --> 00:05:25.120
At work when everyone is out, Granny&nbsp;
gets some alone time with her grandson&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:30.000
for the first time. She picks him up from the&nbsp;
bus stop and takes him to the park. The kid’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:34.880
parents are always busy so he is delighted to&nbsp;
finally have someone to play with. They spend&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:34.880 --> 00:05:40.000
the entire day together playing and learning.
When his mother returns home, she sees that the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:44.720
kid is silently eating food on his own. She&nbsp;
is impressed by Granny’s skills because it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:44.720 --> 00:05:49.680
has always been difficult for her to feed her son.&nbsp;
Granny teaches her a few tricks about parenting,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:54.480
after which she decides not to fire her.&nbsp;
The next day, they shoot the first episode&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:54.480 --> 00:05:59.600
of the cursing competition. Granny has to go&nbsp;
against several youngsters but she is confident&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:59.600 --> 00:06:04.800
because no one is as good as her. She makes&nbsp;
some of them cry with only her words. One of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:13.200
them even passes out not being able to handle the&nbsp;
profanities. She also goes against a beatboxer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:13.200 --> 00:06:18.400
who makes inappropriate hand gestures. Just when&nbsp;
everyone thinks she is about to lose this one, she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:18.400 --> 00:06:24.080
claps back with even filthier movements that make&nbsp;
the guy almost cry. At the end of the episode,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:29.280
Granny gathers many fans around Korea. Because&nbsp;
of her, the program is a hit. The chairman’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:34.320
wife who has stolen money from the granny sees&nbsp;
her on TV and finds out where she lives.
&nbsp;

00:06:34.320 --> 00:06:38.880
While working at Seung-hyeon’s home, she makes&nbsp;
sure to try to reconnect with him. She also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:44.080
discovers a photo album in his cabin with an old&nbsp;
picture of her. This makes her hope that her son&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:44.080 --> 00:06:49.200
will eventually forgive her. One day, she meets&nbsp;
the Chairman's wife and her friend on the street.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:53.840
The women beg for forgiveness for their deeds.&nbsp;
Although their mistake had caused Granny to be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:53.840 --> 00:06:58.720
separated from her children, she forgives them and&nbsp;
tells them that she doesn’t want the money back.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:58.720 --> 00:07:04.320
In the next episode of the cursing competition, a&nbsp;
lawyer is made to go against a girl. It is almost&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:04.320 --> 00:07:10.080
impossible to win against the lawyer who uses his&nbsp;
knowledge of the constitution to argue. Meanwhile,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:10.080 --> 00:07:14.720
Granny goes against a rapper who freestyles&nbsp;
his diss. But after cursing at the audience&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:14.720 --> 00:07:20.000
to yell louder and hyping them up, Granny wins&nbsp;
this round as well. The producer of the show&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:25.520
is over the moon after the broadcast. The ratings&nbsp;
have skyrocketed because of Granny. To stir more&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:25.520 --> 00:07:30.960
drama, he sends people to find out about Granny’s&nbsp;
past so her opponents can use it to diss her.
&nbsp;

00:07:35.040 --> 00:07:40.320
One day, Granny is with Seung-hyeon’s wife&nbsp;
visiting the market when she sees a shopkeeper&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:45.280
hitting his wife. She calls him out for it and&nbsp;
throws profanities at him. The people around her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:45.280 --> 00:07:50.480
start to recognize her so she quickly walks back&nbsp;
to the house. Granny and Seung-hyeon’s wife start&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:50.480 --> 00:07:55.360
to get along well. Moreover, Seung-hyeon’s&nbsp;
son treats her like his own grandmother,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:55.360 --> 00:07:59.600
even though he doesn’t know it. Seung-hyeon,&nbsp;
on the other hand, has finally gathered enough&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:59.600 --> 00:08:04.720
money to buy a house. He asks his real estate&nbsp;
agent for a house with three bedrooms, just in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:04.720 --> 00:08:10.400
case Granny wants to stay with them. He, too, is&nbsp;
opening up to his mother. For the next episode,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:15.280
Granny is made to go against the lawyer while&nbsp;
pretending to be his wife. She makes fun of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:15.280 --> 00:08:21.200
size of his appendage, making everyone laugh. Her&nbsp;
jokes turn into memes which makes her even more&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:26.080
famous. She wins against the unbeatable&nbsp;
lawyer and reaches the final round. 
&nbsp;

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:31.520
The lawyer is enraged by the loss and humiliation&nbsp;
he had to face on national television. To take&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:31.520 --> 00:08:38.160
revenge on Granny, he digs up her past and finds&nbsp;
out she abandoned her sons and is an ex-con. Soon,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:43.840
the word goes around and the man Granny kicked out&nbsp;
of the train testifies against her on TV. As the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:43.840 --> 00:08:49.040
news spreads, random people join the bandwagon,&nbsp;
coming out with false accusations against her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:54.560
People find out that Seung-hyeon and Joo-hyeon&nbsp;
are her sons. Seung-hyeon’s colleague, who already&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:54.560 --> 00:08:59.200
thought he was a loser, makes fun of him because&nbsp;
of his mother. This triggers the trauma that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:04.720
Seung-hyeon has been suppressing his entire life.&nbsp;
Moreover, his mother-in-law also finds out about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:04.720 --> 00:09:10.400
his mother and blames him for bringing his ex-con&nbsp;
mother into their house. Taking the opportunity,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:17.360
she declares that her daughter is divorcing him&nbsp;
soon. Granny gets on her knees and begs the woman&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:22.880
not to ruin her son’s life just because she is mad&nbsp;
at her. However, the mother-in-law kicks her out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:22.880 --> 00:09:28.880
of the house after insulting her. When Granny&nbsp;
returns home, Joo-hyeon is furious at her. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:33.520
hadn’t known that she had been working as a maid&nbsp;
at Seung-hyeon’s house. He hates the fact that his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:33.520 --> 00:09:38.720
mother favors his elder brother more than him.&nbsp;
The two get into a huge argument when suddenly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:43.840
Granny starts to cough uncontrollably. 
Joo-hyeon and his wife go to the doctor and show&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:43.840 --> 00:09:48.960
him the medicine that Granny takes, only to find&nbsp;
out that she has a weak heart and probably has had&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:48.960 --> 00:09:54.000
a few heart attacks when she was in prison. That&nbsp;
night, Granny gets a call from Seung-hyeon’s wife&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:59.040
who informs her that he hasn’t returned home.&nbsp;
Granny goes to his work and asks his colleagues&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:59.040 --> 00:10:04.080
about him but they too, have no answer. She&nbsp;
doesn’t agree to leave until they tell her where&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:09.840
he is which causes a huge fuss in the office. The&nbsp;
chairman notices this and comes out of his cabin.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:09.840 --> 00:10:15.200
He instantly recognizes Granny as the woman who&nbsp;
saved his life in prison. He kneels in front of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:15.200 --> 00:10:20.720
her in gratitude, surprising his employees. They&nbsp;
finally listen to Granny’s request and kindly tell&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:25.760
her that they haven’t seen Seung-hyeon since&nbsp;
the last day. Meanwhile, outside the studio,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:25.760 --> 00:10:30.800
a crowd has gathered to protest against the&nbsp;
cursing competition, claiming that it is immoral&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:30.800 --> 00:10:36.800
for giving an ex-con a platform. The last episode&nbsp;
is about to begin but Granny hasn’t come to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:36.800 --> 00:10:42.560
set. In the following scene, we see Seung-hyeon&nbsp;
in his car. Nothing in his life is going right&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:42.560 --> 00:10:48.000
so he has decided to commit suicide. He&nbsp;
drives into a wall and falls unconscious. 
&nbsp;

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:53.280
In the meantime, Granny goes to the studio but is&nbsp;
clearly not ready for the last round. On top of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:53.280 --> 00:10:58.320
that, she has to go against another old woman&nbsp;
who hasn’t lost a single round till now. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:58.320 --> 00:11:03.280
competition gets more difficult for Granny when it&nbsp;
is announced that they have to fight like a mother&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:08.800
and son. Her opponent goes as a son and insults&nbsp;
her. But when it is Granny's turn to speak,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:08.800 --> 00:11:14.320
she stays silent. A man from the audience throws&nbsp;
an egg to her face, humiliating her in front of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:14.320 --> 00:11:19.920
everyone. She speaks for the first time and claims&nbsp;
that everyone who is cursing at her right now is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:19.920 --> 00:11:24.800
right. Instead of insulting the opponent, Granny&nbsp;
explains how she has been a horrible mother to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:24.800 --> 00:11:30.480
her kids. At last, she breaks down crying and&nbsp;
says that she loves her children dearly. As she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:30.480 --> 00:11:35.680
gives the heartfelt speech, Seung-hyeon crawls&nbsp;
out of the car and is saved by people nearby.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:35.680 --> 00:11:40.640
Granny’s words inspire many people from around&nbsp;
the country. They start to yell profanities at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:40.640 --> 00:11:45.440
everything that has been bothering them in life.&nbsp;
Granny’s opponent goes silent and she finally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:45.440 --> 00:11:51.280
wins the competition. However, she vomits&nbsp;
blood and falls unconscious right after. 
&nbsp;

00:11:51.280 --> 00:11:55.040
She is admitted to the hospital where&nbsp;
Seung-hyeon comes to see her and calls&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:55.040 --> 00:12:01.200
her mom for the first time in decades. Granny is&nbsp;
now surrounded by her family who loves her dearly.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:06.480
She soon gets well and comes out of the hospital&nbsp;
as a celebrity. The women who had stolen from her,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:06.480 --> 00:12:11.200
agree to return all the money with interest.&nbsp;
Seung-hyeon’s mother-in-law sees Granny’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:16.000
connections and apologizes to her. At the&nbsp;
end of the movie, she gets inside a car to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:20.560
fly to America for heart surgery. 
